{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:893b042befa59a0503a55e1e7aae931cdd3907ee8d2c5d99de015cda7f62f156",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a928d394fc6c5ad3271e86337bf98fe2e819aa637d4de3e44007c928b722326",
      "text": "感受到了季节的变迁喵～。\n宣传活动也顺利结束，深受老少男女的好评♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6b05142c4c1d77bdc8eca0e25572d93773f9dcb5eda5317680befe235a4e1b",
      "text": "所以吾辈觉得，必须向●●●●プロデューサー君\n道声谢，就打了这通电话喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a06717894bfca1b7bc311102567f8e5039c6d87fd18316cdc397f7574c53d8f",
      "text": "道谢吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76982df15c03f1feee5443fe3696ddf9a4cc321bd0394962a509f7648bb7f0d7",
      "text": "那个下雨天，制作人君陪着吾辈一起\n出门散步了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e33bb5ea045e7a205f4359d3fa94ee2da397603231ae683ee47db69fd8f15e0e",
      "text": "虽然一个人散步也很有趣喵……\n但和别人在一起，能看到的东西就翻倍了喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13aaeb98d947758b4ad5ed8409dff8087ff1a1058b161799e6267ef31b3d7c0c",
      "text": "多亏了你，宣传活动的准备万无一失，段子的素材也\n咕嘟咕嘟冒个不停，真是一举两得！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1d891ca50678514c55f9ea02eb22e234049be2485f2c2b2e225bd15819253ac",
      "text": "而且还能开心地聊天，简直成了一举三得的\n超值时光喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:892294142ca3ab12331a669b9eb32c34c0b8d55125c4158469d91296dbd5454c",
      "text": "下次再去\n散步吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1aaf2e536bb70973def7c318fea469eab334de3d35bf285ddaccd67ad34eaed",
      "text": "也请讲小段子\n给我听听呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:386756936d0d45c02b70ab53150250caaf53ce09a06da004f1917682659a12b1",
      "text": "那可太棒了喵～。哈……光是从今天这天气里，\n就嗅到了新段子的气息喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ad308b64a051cc3cf089fa5b62651da5f65fb382517662560a10181e6027f57",
      "text": "喵呼呼呼……那么，吾辈这就准备好压箱绝活，\n立刻赶去事务所喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:017kir_402_2_4_017_02_09_a:2_4_017_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6495b535cdb04a66af7f4ac87bb057213821e97e5498810f18b9bb94461579ed",
      "text": "既然决定了，就得麻利地收拾好行装，\n赶快出发喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
